It is afternoon.
I sit at my desk.
I work with focus.
I type the software code.
I test that code.
Time passes quickly.
Slowly, it becomes evening.
I finish my work.
I save all the code.
I close my laptop.
I put the laptop in the bag.
Rohan comes near.
"Maya, are you going home?" he asks.
"Yes, I am leaving now," I say.
"See you tomorrow," Rohan says.
I say goodbye to the other colleagues too.
Everyone says 'bye' to me.
I take my bag.
I step out of the office.
I come out of the building.
